      "I Can’t See You",
      "",
      "Anne: Hello, sir, I am on the roadside waiting for you. I saw your car. Drive forward a bit.",
      "",
      "Driver: Sure. Where are you? I can’t see you!",
      "",
      "Anne: Ah! Sir, you have driven past me. Drive backwards a bit. I am wearing a black jacket.",
      "",
      "Driver: I can’t see you! Where are you? I can only see a foreigner.",
      "",
      "Anne: Sir, I am that foreigner!",
      "",
      "Driver: Okay, sorry about that! I couldn’t tell that you were a foreigner. You speak Chinese so well!",
      ""
